abstract: >-
  Analysis code, review checks and a small data pack for an independent study of Bangladesh's
  2026 load shedding, built from public hourly PGCB grid data (2015 to 15 November 2026),
  BPDB daily zone reports and Open-Meteo weather. Every published finding is recomputed a
  second way by 05_review/verify.py.
